s they face every day.\n\nThe goal is to record one of these every couple of days, and jump into one section of the book, and talk about some of the insights, some of the things that made it into the book, and some of the things that didn’t.\n\nThis episode is all about the various life-changing moments where vibe coding literally changed our lives. We tell those stories, and explain why we're both having so much fun.\n\nPre-order the book here: https://www.amazon.com/Vibe-Coding-Bu...\n\n00:00 Introduction to Vibe Coding Podcast\n01:00 Meet the Hosts: Gene and Steve\n02:06 Steve's Career Journey\n06:30 Gene's Background and Coding Revival\n09:30 The Birth of Vibe Coding\n11:27 Transformative Coding Experiences\n25:01 Future Episodes and Book InsightsThis is a video about NEW EPISODE 1","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":966,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAciEwjsx4imh7qXAxVISEwIHRBSGFBIvOK04-v_noQvygEEaqVdKA==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUZZTVljRmswU1NjRldLUUV4VWdkdnZ0TzdNb3xBSTVJdTVzeUxhcXBWV0t5cHhsXzhWLTQ1NkhpeEdHTG1JUVR4YVEtSDRMWUN4ZkNZdzVjY09SeUNzbS1UUktnekN3MmFUcHBEdE12UHhIUGg5NlVOb1dxRFpkU2lDakZieXJP\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FVibe-Coding-Building-Production-Grade-Software%2Fdp%2F1966280025\u0026v=Lwh7_rxtMTw","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUZZTVljRmswU1NjRldLUUV4VWdkdnZ0TzdNb3xBSTVJdTVzeUxhcXBWV0t5cHhsXzhWLTQ1NkhpeEdHTG1JUVR4YVEtSDRMWUN4ZkNZdzVjY09SeUNzbS1UUktnekN3MmFUcHBEdE12UHhIUGg5NlVOb1dxRFpkU2lDakZieXJP\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FVibe-Coding-Building-Production-Grade-Software%2Fdp%2F1966280025\u0026v=Lwh7_rxtMTw","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":1008,"length":5,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAciEwjsx4imh7qXAxVISEwIHRBSGFDKAQR